# TeX Live packages required to build the CTAN submission archive via
# release.sh (see .github/workflows/ctan.yml). One package per line;
# "#" starts a comment.
#
# This is a superset of tl_packages: it also contains the packages that
# pandoc's default LaTeX template pulls in when converting README.md to
# scientific-thesis-cover.pdf, plus ctanify itself. The pandoc-template
# dependencies were detected with DEPP (https://gitlab.com/islandoftex/texmf/depp)
# on a standalone LaTeX export of the README.
#
# ctanify additionally needs the Perl module File::Copy::Recursive, which is
# installed in the workflow via apt (libfile-copy-recursive-perl).
